  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiative Africa-Empowering Girls Building Communities (Initiative Africa)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Initiative Africa-Empowering Girls Building Communities (Initiative Africa)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;EMPOWERING YOUNG GIRLS - Building Communities&apos; is an Initiative      Africa designed project                                                targeting mostly girls in grades 9 -12 who have a desire to          graduate, as well as out of school youths                              who wish to improve their opportunities. The initiative is mainly    about getting girls in secondary school and ensuring they have a safe school Environment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&apos;EMPOWERING YOUNG GIRLS - Building Communities&apos; is an Initiative Africa projekt som riktar sig till skolflickor i &#xe5;ldern 9-12 &#xe5;r. Projektet syftar till att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r en s&#xe4;ker skolmilj&#xf6; utan v&#xe5;ld.</narrative>
  </description>
